'''Red Celestial''' is a [[Unique Weapons|unique]] knife obtained by finishing in the top 100 on the tokens collecting leaderboard {{Currency|Snow Token}} during the [[Christmas Event 2024]].

== Appearance ==
It has the same mesh as the godly variant of [[Celestial]], but it's color scheme has been altered to red-white colors.

== Trivia ==
* It has [[Bronze Celestial|bronze]], [[Silver Celestial|silver]] and [[Gold Celestial|gold]] variants.
* Like all the other [[Unique Weapons|unique weapons]] (Except [[Corrupt]]), this item is [[Trading|untradable]].

